      {
        "_uid": "7e2b5da6-1a62-7c2a-5ec2-98799e0473f0",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In Karachi, 500 saplings of 25 different fruit, medicinal and ornamental species were planted by students and employees of AKU at the Education City site on the outskirts of the city, making this a site for environmental research and engagement.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Successful land restoration requires a multi-faceted, multi-generational approach that aligns knowledge with engagement and action. AKU, with our AKDN and other partners, is committed to ensuring environmental protection and sustainability, to empower communities towards climate resilience, and to share our learning widely.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Discover more about AKU's environment and sustainability work ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "here",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.aku.edu/about/environment/Pages/home.aspx",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
